WEBVTT

00:00:02.499 --> 00:00:04.626
It's only a matter of time before we capture

00:00:04.626 --> 00:00:08.756
the girl who calls herself the legendary
thief Doronjo and her gang.

00:00:08.756 --> 00:00:10.966
Please leave it to me.

00:00:12.384 --> 00:00:14.136
Yatterman!

00:00:22.311 --> 00:00:26.065
Lord and Lady Yatterman saved my life.

00:00:26.065 --> 00:00:30.110
I'll risk that life to capture the
rebels and punish them severely!

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:01.060
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:06.860
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:11.700
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:17.410
And came to a standstill myself

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:22.580
We don't need no reasons

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:27.670
To change for the better

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:34.970
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:37.060
You're a shooting star

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:40.350
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:45.570
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:47.650
Light on the shooting star

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:53.660
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:56.780
Let's go in search of it

00:01:56.780 --> 00:02:01.540
Fly away

00:02:11.746 --> 00:02:15.416
That's right. Tighten those joints firmly.

00:02:15.416 --> 00:02:17.126
L-Like this?

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:23.758
You're good with your hands and have
a good memory as well, Gatchan.

00:02:23.758 --> 00:02:25.051
You think so?

00:02:30.514 --> 00:02:33.017
I won't let you escape at any cost!

00:02:37.146 --> 00:02:38.314
Don't let them get away!

00:02:41.984 --> 00:02:44.278
It's cold!

00:02:44.278 --> 00:02:46.280
Bear it for a bit.

00:02:56.123 --> 00:03:00.294
Gatchan, don't just use your hands.
Use your entire body.

00:03:00.294 --> 00:03:01.879
Lower your body!

00:03:01.879 --> 00:03:03.464
O-Okay!

00:03:05.424 --> 00:03:07.843
Go for it! Stand firm!

00:03:10.388 --> 00:03:13.808
That's good! You're someone who can
do things if he puts his mind to it.

00:03:13.808 --> 00:03:15.226
Yeah.

00:03:24.819 --> 00:03:27.488
Take this!

00:03:27.488 --> 00:03:29.448
That's nothing!

00:03:32.952 --> 00:03:34.328
Yatter!

00:03:36.122 --> 00:03:39.125
Good bye! Adios! Sayonara!

00:03:39.125 --> 00:03:40.751
Fire! Fire!

00:03:50.803 --> 00:03:53.180
Seriously, Goro is persistent!

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:54.348
OW…

00:03:54.348 --> 00:03:55.683
Are you okay?

00:03:55.683 --> 00:03:59.061
Th-This is nothing!

00:03:59.061 --> 00:04:01.772
Looks like we've shaken them off.

00:04:01.772 --> 00:04:03.733
Let's take a little break.

00:04:03.733 --> 00:04:05.985
It smells good, doesn't it, Gatchan?

00:04:05.985 --> 00:04:07.695
You think so?

00:04:07.695 --> 00:04:12.158
Aren't you cold? Are you going to
sleep under the carpet of snow?

00:04:12.158 --> 00:04:14.952
Do you know what lavender
means in the language of flowers?

00:04:14.952 --> 00:04:16.495
Hm? What does it mean?

00:04:16.495 --> 00:04:19.874
I love the language of flowers.

00:04:26.047 --> 00:04:29.341
Excuse me, Miss Doronjo.
I'd like to make a suggestion.

00:04:29.341 --> 00:04:30.384
Suggestion?

00:04:30.384 --> 00:04:31.969
General Goro is serious.

00:04:31.969 --> 00:04:34.388
Oda doesn't seem like we can
escape from him so easily.

00:04:34.388 --> 00:04:36.432
Yeah.

00:04:36.432 --> 00:04:41.395
So… why don't we give up on giving
Yatterman a forehead flicking for now?

00:04:41.395 --> 00:04:43.689
What?! Give it up?!

00:04:43.689 --> 00:04:46.442
It's too dangerous to go against Yatterman.

00:04:46.442 --> 00:04:47.818
Tonzra!

00:04:47.818 --> 00:04:49.361
He's right.

00:04:49.361 --> 00:04:50.863
You, too, Tonzra?!

00:04:50.863 --> 00:04:55.409
You forgot why we're trying to give
Yatterman a forehead flicking?!

00:04:57.203 --> 00:04:58.746
We do remember it.

00:04:58.746 --> 00:05:01.540
There's no way we'd forget it.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.418
If we don't do it, then who will?!

00:05:04.418 --> 00:05:05.753
Calm down.

00:05:05.753 --> 00:05:08.589
We have to give Yatterman
a forehead flicking, or…

00:05:08.589 --> 00:05:11.217
It's too dangerous, Leopard!

00:05:12.843 --> 00:05:14.386
G-Gatchan!

00:05:14.386 --> 00:05:16.180
What do you think?!

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.599
Well, uhm…

00:05:20.643 --> 00:05:25.439
As Mr. Boyacky and Mr. Tonzra say,
it's too dangerous… I think.

00:05:26.816 --> 00:05:31.445
You too, Gatchan?!
That's it! I'll do it myself, then!

00:05:31.445 --> 00:05:34.782
I'm going by myself!
Who cares about you guys?!

00:05:34.782 --> 00:05:36.826
Don't follow me!

00:05:36.826 --> 00:05:38.494
A-Aren't we going after her?

00:05:38.494 --> 00:05:41.622
She'll probably be back once she calms down.

00:05:41.622 --> 00:05:45.292
Leop… I mean, Miss Doronjo is a smart girl.

00:05:50.464 --> 00:05:52.675
D-Don't follow me!

00:05:52.675 --> 00:05:54.260
She isn't back yet.

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:55.427
Yeah…

00:05:58.764 --> 00:06:00.683
Aren't you gonna follow me?!

00:06:05.771 --> 00:06:09.733
Seriously…! I'm really gonna go!
I'm really gonna go by myself!

00:06:09.733 --> 00:06:11.819
I'm going!

00:06:18.159 --> 00:06:20.286
Yeah… Okay!

00:06:20.286 --> 00:06:21.162
Let's go after her.

00:06:21.162 --> 00:06:24.165
Right! Ally, we're leaving!

00:06:24.165 --> 00:06:25.708
Okay!

00:06:30.504 --> 00:06:34.008
Geez… I told you not to follow me, didn't I?

00:06:34.008 --> 00:06:35.092
Yatter!

00:06:38.721 --> 00:06:39.763
Miss Doronjo?!

00:06:39.763 --> 00:06:41.182
So you're back!

00:06:41.182 --> 00:06:42.600
Doronjo!

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:43.809
Yatter!

00:06:45.186 --> 00:06:47.563
-- Surrender without fighting!
--Yattr! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter…!

00:06:47.563 --> 00:06:49.106
--No! Don't follow me!
--Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter…!

00:06:49.106 --> 00:06:51.400
Take this!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:56.280
I won't let anyone else eat him!

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:57.865
--Tonzra!
--Yep!

00:06:57.865 --> 00:07:01.285
Yo-ho! Yo-ho! Yo-ho…!

00:07:07.541 --> 00:07:09.877
W-Wait for me!

00:07:17.551 --> 00:07:19.803
H-Help!

00:07:33.651 --> 00:07:34.985
You…

00:07:37.196 --> 00:07:39.365
--Take him.
--Yes, sir!

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.286
They're so persistent!

00:07:44.662 --> 00:07:47.915
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:07:47.915 --> 00:07:49.667
A Cliff?!

00:07:52.044 --> 00:07:56.382
Noooooooo!

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:09.186
I thought I was gonna die.

00:08:15.985 --> 00:08:17.653
Dried persimmons!

00:08:23.617 --> 00:08:24.952
No!

00:08:24.952 --> 00:08:28.956
Taking things that belong to others
is stealing. Stealing is wrong!

00:08:28.956 --> 00:08:31.667
It'll make the people who live here sad.

00:08:31.667 --> 00:08:35.129
That'd make me no different from Yatterman!

00:08:35.129 --> 00:08:42.303
Tsk… A dried persimmon thief?
Whose kid is that?

00:08:44.346 --> 00:08:45.681
There she is!

00:08:45.681 --> 00:08:47.141
They're persistent!

00:08:47.141 --> 00:08:49.893
Boyacky! Tonzra! Give them hell!

00:08:49.893 --> 00:08:51.645
Oh, that's right. They aren't with me.

00:08:51.645 --> 00:08:54.773
Oh, come on! Where are you?
Are you leaving me all by myself?!

00:08:54.773 --> 00:08:57.651
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:08:59.403 --> 00:09:01.155
Wh-What do you want?

00:09:01.155 --> 00:09:03.657
Ah! Yatterman!

00:09:03.657 --> 00:09:05.242
Yatterman!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.374
She's a rebel?

00:09:12.374 --> 00:09:13.542
Tsk…!

00:09:19.631 --> 00:09:20.716
This way!

00:09:27.056 --> 00:09:28.849
Miss Doronjo…

00:09:28.849 --> 00:09:31.060
Where are you?

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:34.897
Doronjo… Doronjo…

00:09:34.897 --> 00:09:38.442
Oh, please don't cry, Miss Alouette.

00:09:38.442 --> 00:09:41.904
But if you really must,
please cry in my arms.

00:09:41.904 --> 00:09:43.280
No, in my arms.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.574
--My arms!
--My arms!

00:09:48.952 --> 00:09:50.704
This is no time for that.

00:09:50.704 --> 00:09:53.624
We have to find Miss Doronjo and Gatchan.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.887
Miss Doronjo!

00:09:59.887 --> 00:10:01.598
Where are you?

00:10:04.309 --> 00:10:06.311
Miss Doronjo!

00:10:06.311 --> 00:10:09.147
I made a decision…

00:10:09.147 --> 00:10:11.816
…that I'd protect Miss Leopard,
the daughter of the late Lady Dorothy,

00:10:11.816 --> 00:10:14.277
at the risk of my own life.

00:10:18.448 --> 00:10:21.034
High-school-girls…

00:10:25.204 --> 00:10:28.458
Oh, I'm sorry! Did I say something?

00:10:28.458 --> 00:10:31.002
I couldn't hear it clearly.

00:10:32.629 --> 00:10:34.297
Voltkatze…

00:10:37.634 --> 00:10:39.093
What's this for?

00:10:39.093 --> 00:10:42.930
A gift for you… It's just something
I found in a closet, though.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:47.935
For me?! Thank you very much! I'll treasure it!

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:53.650
I couldn't protect Lady Dorothy,
so in order to at least make up for it…

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.193
That's why…

00:10:55.193 --> 00:10:59.572
You wanted to get her to give up on
giving Yatterman a forehead flicking…

00:11:00.948 --> 00:11:03.534
…in order to protect Miss Doronjo, right?

00:11:03.534 --> 00:11:05.161
So did I.

00:11:07.246 --> 00:11:09.165
Elephantus!

00:11:09.165 --> 00:11:11.250
Th-This is for me?

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.504
I made it for you.
Thank you for what you do for us.

00:11:15.755 --> 00:11:19.634
I-I'll treasure it for the rest of my life!

00:11:19.634 --> 00:11:21.678
You're overreacting.

00:11:23.054 --> 00:11:26.641
And yet, I let her go alone…

00:11:26.641 --> 00:11:30.186
…even though I was trying to protect her…

00:11:31.521 --> 00:11:34.440
Watching Miss Doronjo since
we came to Yatter Kingdom,

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:38.653
there's something I've come to realize.

00:11:38.653 --> 00:11:43.950
Lady Dorothy… I mean, Miss Alouette
thinks that Miss Doronjo is an angel.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:47.662
I'm thinking that it might really be true.

00:11:47.662 --> 00:11:50.206
When she sees people suffering,

00:11:50.206 --> 00:11:54.377
she can feel sad, get upset and cry for them.

00:11:54.377 --> 00:11:57.547
She feels all that not only
for herself, but also for others.

00:11:57.547 --> 00:11:59.132
Because she's like that,

00:11:59.132 --> 00:12:03.928
she might really be able to
bring a new dawn to this world.

00:12:06.723 --> 00:12:08.182
Yeah…

00:12:08.182 --> 00:12:14.397
So getting her to give up
isn't what we have to do.

00:12:14.397 --> 00:12:18.109
Yeah. What we have to do is…

00:12:18.109 --> 00:12:19.277
Honorable Oda?!

00:12:19.277 --> 00:12:21.612
Is it Miss Doronjo or Yatter soldiers?!

00:12:23.197 --> 00:12:24.824
It's cold, oink.

00:12:32.582 --> 00:12:35.835
Oh no, I fell asleep.

00:12:35.835 --> 00:12:39.297
I have to head north… to Yatter Metropolis.

00:12:49.182 --> 00:12:52.226
Boyacky… Tonzra… What're you doing?

00:12:52.226 --> 00:12:54.437
Where are you when I really need you?

00:12:54.437 --> 00:12:59.442
You always… You always protected me.

00:12:59.442 --> 00:13:03.112
You tried to get me to give up on
giving Yatterman a forehead flicking

00:13:03.112 --> 00:13:08.618
because you were worried
about me. I knew that, but I…

00:13:08.618 --> 00:13:14.123
Alouette .. Gatchan…
Guys… Where are you?!

00:13:24.592 --> 00:13:27.136
I can't move…

00:13:27.136 --> 00:13:28.930
No… No…

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:32.308
I haven't achieved… anything…

00:13:32.308 --> 00:13:35.144
No… Mom…

00:13:45.321 --> 00:13:47.865
Haven't you found Doronjo and her gang yet?

00:13:47.865 --> 00:13:49.116
No, sir!

00:13:49.116 --> 00:13:51.661
What's that kid we captured saying?

00:13:52.829 --> 00:13:56.457
One means I'll be okay.
Two means I won't be okay.

00:13:56.457 --> 00:13:59.544
Six means… we'll all be happy one day.

00:13:59.544 --> 00:14:03.339
That boy named Galina
seems to know nothing.

00:14:03.339 --> 00:14:05.132
Hm? Galina?

00:14:05.132 --> 00:14:06.509
ls something wrong?

00:14:06.509 --> 00:14:10.304
No, never mind. It's a waste of time
to search for them randomly.

00:14:10.304 --> 00:14:12.306
We've got bait, so lure them out.

00:14:12.306 --> 00:14:13.474
Yes, sir!

00:14:13.474 --> 00:14:16.686
I'll show no mercy to rebels.

00:14:23.192 --> 00:14:26.529
Lavender… Am I in heaven?

00:14:26.529 --> 00:14:28.489
Tsk. This is no heaven.

00:14:28.489 --> 00:14:29.782
Hm?

00:14:29.782 --> 00:14:32.076
It's hell. Where else could it be?

00:14:32.076 --> 00:14:35.997
It's hell confined in a long, long winter.

00:14:35.997 --> 00:14:37.999
Mister…?

00:14:40.668 --> 00:14:42.253
My mask!

00:14:48.384 --> 00:14:49.844
You saved me?

00:14:49.844 --> 00:14:53.556
Tsk. How could I have just left you there?

00:14:53.556 --> 00:14:56.934
Listen. You came in here on your own.

00:14:56.934 --> 00:14:59.729
And, you'll be gone in the morning.

00:14:59.729 --> 00:15:00.897
Got that?

00:15:03.816 --> 00:15:07.653
I'll contact Yatter soldiers in the morning.

00:15:07.653 --> 00:15:08.738
Okay!

00:15:14.994 --> 00:15:16.579
U-Uhm…

00:15:16.579 --> 00:15:19.916
The lavenders are very pretty.

00:15:19.916 --> 00:15:22.418
Do you know what they mean
in the language of flowers?

00:15:32.219 --> 00:15:33.846
This is yummy…

00:15:34.972 --> 00:15:36.724
This is yummy…

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:45.733
He was scared of Yatter soldiers
finding out that he helped me…

00:15:45.733 --> 00:15:50.613
I feel bad that he's scared
like that all the time…

00:15:50.613 --> 00:15:55.117
But I can't do anything… by myself…

00:15:59.163 --> 00:16:02.500
Er… Can you hear me?!

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.710
To the rebels!

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:10.424
At dawn, we'll give a severe
punishment to the rebels we captured!

00:16:10.424 --> 00:16:11.759
That's all I have to say!

00:16:11.759 --> 00:16:17.848
The ones they captured? Boyacky…
Tonzra… Alouette… Gatchan…?

00:16:17.848 --> 00:16:20.226
Is it Gatchan or Miss Doronjo?

00:16:20.226 --> 00:16:21.978
It could be both.

00:16:21.978 --> 00:16:23.938
Rebles, he said?

00:16:23.938 --> 00:16:26.565
ls that the punishment he was talking about?

00:16:26.565 --> 00:16:29.360
He looks young.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.363
Tsk… They're trying to make an example.

00:16:32.363 --> 00:16:34.699
General Goro, it's almost dawn.

00:16:34.699 --> 00:16:36.993
Don't let your guard down.

00:16:36.993 --> 00:16:38.953
Do you think they'll come rescue him?

00:16:38.953 --> 00:16:44.333
Well, even if they don't,
we can still get rid of one rebel.

00:16:44.333 --> 00:16:45.876
Gatchan…

00:16:45.876 --> 00:16:50.256
What should I do…?
I can't do anything by myself.

00:16:56.095 --> 00:16:57.930
It's time.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:00.766
Time to punish him!

00:17:00.766 --> 00:17:02.018
Ally…

00:17:03.686 --> 00:17:07.398
If you want to say something
before you die, now's the time.

00:17:07.398 --> 00:17:10.860
Something before I die… What should I say…?

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:13.863
Uhm… may I roll a die?

00:17:13.863 --> 00:17:15.698
Oh, geez…

00:17:15.698 --> 00:17:18.075
Soldiers! Take a step forward!

00:17:19.827 --> 00:17:23.205
If I don't do anything here,
it's like I killed him…

00:17:23.205 --> 00:17:25.875
I'd be no different from Yatterman.

00:17:26.584 --> 00:17:32.840
But… But… I can't…
I can't do anything by myself!

00:17:35.217 --> 00:17:36.302
What?

00:17:36.302 --> 00:17:38.721
That's what lavender means
in the language of flowers.

00:17:38.721 --> 00:17:40.473
Mister…

00:17:43.601 --> 00:17:44.727
Ready…!

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:56.447
Tsk! She's reckless!

00:18:12.963 --> 00:18:14.799
Doronjo?

00:18:22.139 --> 00:18:23.933
Doronjo!

00:18:26.811 --> 00:18:30.231
So, she's alone? Aim!

00:18:30.231 --> 00:18:31.816
Doronjo, it's impossible!

00:18:31.816 --> 00:18:34.902
It's not impossible!
Where there's a Will, there's a way!

00:18:34.902 --> 00:18:36.112
Doronjo…

00:18:36.278 --> 00:18:37.947
Do you have anything you
wanna say before you die?

00:18:37.947 --> 00:18:41.325
I do! You do, too, right, Gatchan?!

00:18:47.706 --> 00:18:50.292
Doronjo!

00:18:50.292 --> 00:18:52.586
One, two, three…

00:18:52.586 --> 00:18:57.800
Yatterman is a damned fool!

00:19:07.852 --> 00:19:12.022
You've got some guts.
I'll give you that much.

00:19:12.022 --> 00:19:13.607
Fire!

00:19:21.657 --> 00:19:24.326
Flower-picker.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.873
Miss Doronjo! You're being too reckless!

00:19:28.873 --> 00:19:30.457
Boyacky!

00:19:30.457 --> 00:19:32.376
Doronjo!

00:19:32.376 --> 00:19:33.502
Everyone…!

00:19:33.502 --> 00:19:36.505
What were you gonna do
if we didn't show up?!

00:19:36.505 --> 00:19:39.175
Ha! I knew you'd come!

00:19:41.594 --> 00:19:44.138
I'll be waiting, oink!

00:19:50.853 --> 00:19:53.314
General Goro… General Goro…!

00:19:53.314 --> 00:19:54.773
General Goro!

00:19:54.773 --> 00:19:57.443
Shoot them! Don't let them get away!

00:19:57.443 --> 00:19:58.527
Miss Doronjo!

00:19:58.527 --> 00:20:02.198
Guys, give them hell!

00:20:02.198 --> 00:20:04.200
Yes, ma'am!

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:06.702
Flower-picker!

00:20:06.702 --> 00:20:08.329
Flowers!

00:20:09.914 --> 00:20:11.040
She likes me…

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.458
Flowers!

00:20:12.458 --> 00:20:13.459
She likes me not…

00:20:13.459 --> 00:20:14.251
Flowers!

00:20:14.251 --> 00:20:19.006
She likes me. She likes me not.
She likes me. She likes me not…

00:20:19.006 --> 00:20:20.132
Y-You guys…!

00:20:20.132 --> 00:20:22.551
The moving reunion can wait!
We gotta get out of here!

00:20:22.551 --> 00:20:23.719
She likes me.

00:20:23.719 --> 00:20:24.970
Flower-picker!

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:26.055
After them!

00:20:27.014 --> 00:20:28.140
Can we escape?

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:29.683
Don't worry!

00:20:29.683 --> 00:20:33.979
That's it for you. You can't run anymore!

00:20:35.481 --> 00:20:36.649
What're we gonna do?

00:20:36.649 --> 00:20:37.900
Don't worry.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:39.985
You said, "Don't worry"
earlier, too, didn't you?!

00:20:39.985 --> 00:20:42.529
I thought something like this
might happen, so we went ahead and…

00:20:42.529 --> 00:20:43.530
Get them!

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:45.616
Yatter! Yatter!

00:20:47.076 --> 00:20:48.619
And, <i>click!</i>

00:20:57.419 --> 00:20:59.588
We dug a pitfall beforehand.

00:20:59.588 --> 00:21:01.507
Boyacky! Tonzra!

00:21:01.507 --> 00:21:05.177
You guys rock! You guys rock 'n' roll!
You guys are rock stars!

00:21:08.973 --> 00:21:14.687
Miss Doronjo. We won't
tell you to give up anymore.

00:21:14.687 --> 00:21:16.021
That's right.

00:21:16.021 --> 00:21:18.816
Rather than trying to get you to
give up in order to keep you safe,

00:21:18.816 --> 00:21:22.111
we'll protect you so that you
can make your wish come true!

00:21:22.111 --> 00:21:23.696
That is…

00:21:23.696 --> 00:21:25.281
…our duty!

00:21:28.701 --> 00:21:34.873
Tsk… The long winter may be on
its way out… and spring may come.

00:21:42.506 --> 00:21:43.674
Doronjo!

00:21:43.674 --> 00:21:44.675
Boyacky!

00:21:44.675 --> 00:21:45.676
Tonzra!

00:21:45.676 --> 00:21:47.761
Honorable Oda, oink!

00:21:47.761 --> 00:21:51.640
This world is covered by
darkness because of Yatterman!

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.851
What we need to do is
not a forehead flicking!

00:21:53.851 --> 00:21:57.187
We'll bring down Yatterman!

00:21:57.187 --> 00:21:59.440
Be pure! Be right! Be beautiful!

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:01.108
As long as Doronbow exists,

00:22:01.108 --> 00:22:04.028
Yatterman will have ne place in this world!

00:22:04.028 --> 00:22:09.283
We'll bring down Yatterman and
bring a new dawn to this world!

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:18.090
Should I raise my RPM and dream?

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:25.720
Don't put it off for tomorrow, do it now

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:28.020
My strong heart wants to get started

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:30.100
I want to see change, so let's go

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:35.650
I'm running too fast to smell the roses

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:37.690
My strong heart's at max speed

00:22:37.690 --> 00:22:40.280
I made a wish because I wanted a change

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:44.240
I search, I tire, I fall, and I get back up

00:22:44.240 --> 00:22:50.870
I'll enjoy this every time

00:22:51.580 --> 00:22:53.540
Continue your passion

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:56.000
Continue your passion

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:57.290
I'll support you

00:22:57.290 --> 00:22:58.250
I'm on your side

00:22:58.250 --> 00:22:59.510
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:01.300
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:05.760
My drive ain't no work of fiction

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:06.970
I want to see you

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:08.010
Today, if I can

00:23:08.010 --> 00:23:09.770
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:11.140
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:15.230
Don't you know?

00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:16.560
Day and night, I'm missing you

00:23:16.190 --> 00:23:17.900
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:17.900
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:19.820
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:20.280
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:20.280 --> 00:23:23.030
But continue your passions

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:26.200
But continue your passions

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:38.000
Keep praying and dreaming
